-4c05-aabf-5df7af637638" endid="#m-1eb184f2-d69b-4d59-9dc8-29aac035f0b4" corresp="#m-comment-3"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-3-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>im Verhältnis zu Tradition eine Quarte höher notiert; korrigiert (((A?))) aus</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-3-notes-1"/></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-370cd125-14fb-4e00-ab5e-f92925deb046" endid="#m-4122ebbf-7cdf-43da-b3a0-21d70a92b5a9" corresp="#m-comment-4"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-4-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert (((B))) aus</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-4-notes-1"/></td><td><rend>folgt Kustos auf ((e)).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-2f795f5d-93ad-444a-97e8-9bea9e71220a" endid="#m-aaf70448-ac9d-45f8-9641-928240ee307a" corresp="#m-comment-5"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-5-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert (((B))) aus</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-5-notes-1"/></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-51f66d21-14bb-416c-876c-ed3a61476a83" endid="#m-f8aefb3c-460f-4724-ba15-d650ae18af7e" corresp="#m-comment-6"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-6-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert (((A))) aus</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-6-notes-1"/></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-4518d836-e6a5-4059-bf8b-a319f0471383" endid="#m-762e1cf9-c733-489b-9e35-a0371257a773" corresp="#m-comment-7"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-7-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert (((A))) aus</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-7-notes-1"/></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-7d690d1a-2195-4553-b751-deb64bf7bacb" endid="#m-6dfed8a0-efd8-438e-8e2c-e476436b987d" corresp="#m-comment-8"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-8-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>im Verhältnis zur Tradition der Antiphon eine Oktave höher notiert.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-404995a2-1710-4c9e-9ce6-10f9fb0ce042" endid="#m-241a5e02-0b97-4307-88b9-dcdf899fb149" corresp="#m-comment-9"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-9-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert (((B))) aus</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-9-notes-1"/></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-8bf9e919-de1f-4abe-ad07-2864056abf56" endid="#m-f7247efd-60fa-4d3b-aacd-b0bf9907713a" corresp="#m-comment-10"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-10-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert (((A))) aus</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-10-notes-1"/></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-e73a11ad-1758-4061-9563-7f247e8851b3" endid="#m-f122d14d-f12d-42f4-8ace-5394094d6fee" corresp="#m-comment-11"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-11-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>im Verhältnis zur Tradition der Antiphon eine Quarte höher notiert; folgt Kustos auf c.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-4ccf8008-d483-42e1-9f20-cbb892c81a0a" endid="#m-4ccf8008-d483-42e1-9f20-cbb892c81a0a" corresp="#m-comment-12"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-12-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-12-notes-1"/></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-904b2ecd-1dcc-40a2-ad27-7a8080f03d89" endid="#m-0c0d3d84-4afc-4ae6-b769-278238ff16e2" type="emendation" corresp="#m-comment-13"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-13-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-13-notes-1"/></td><td><rend>korrigiert (B) aus</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-13-notes-2"/></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-5bc78943-33db-4214-85bd-4744d9eb04bd" endid="#m-722e0844-e7b5-4b36-b69b-292404b54437" type="emendation" corresp="#m-comment-14"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-14-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-14-notes-1"/></td><td><rend>Lesart vor Korrektur nicht sicher lesbar; vermutlich korrigiert (((B))) aus</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-14-notes-2"/></td></tr></table></annot><annot type="global-comment"><table><tr><td><rend>((140, 141, 143, 142:)) 8p 8p 7pp.</rend></td></tr><tr><td><rend>Vgl. ((AH 55, S. 374)) (Versikel 1-4 der Sequenz).</rend></td></tr><tr><td><rend>Die Handschrift enthält zahlreiche Korrekturen. Es lassen sich (vor allem anhand der Tintenfarbe) unterscheiden: (((A))) sofort vorgenommene Korrekturen des Schreibers (hauptsächlich Schreibfehler betreffend) und (((B))) Korrekturen nach der vollständigen Niederschrift, die in den Parallelstrophen analog durchgeführt sind. Soweit erkennbar, wurde diese Differenzierung im Folgenden vermerkt.</rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-m-5539"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">Mü 5539</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><application version="0.9.1"><name>Monodi-Zero</name></application></appInfo></encodingDesc><workList><work><identifier>Mü 5539-69-3</identifier><title>Ecce dies triumphalis gaude</title><incip><incipText><p>Ecce dies triumphalis gaude</p></incipText></incip><contents><contentItem><locus from="69">f. 69, l. 3</locus></contentItem></contents><biblList><bibl>Ded intr 140 A 141 B 143 C 142 A (CT VIII)</bibl><bibl type="printed-edition">II-2</bibl></biblList><classification><termList><term type="genre">Tropus</term><term type="genre">Introitus-Tropus</term><term type="feast">Dedicatio ecclesiae</term><term type="feast">Messe</term><term type="Editor">Isabel Kraft</term><term type="Bezugsgesang">(Terribilis)</term><term type="Endseite">69v</term><term type="Endzeile">7</term><term type="FestUndGattung">Ded intr</term><term type="Band_Genre">Tropus</term></termList></classification></work></workList><manifestationList><manifestation><identifier type="siglum">Mü 5539</identifier><titleStmt><title>Mü 5539</title></titleStmt><creation><geogName role="origin">Dießen</geogName><geogName role="origin-region">Quellen deutscher Herk